<title>USA: S&amp;P adds Lucent to S&amp;P 500 Index.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P adds Lucent to S&amp;P 500 Index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Tuesday it will add Lucent Technologies Inc to the S&amp;P 500 Index after the close of trading on September 30.</p>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp is spinning off its remaining 82 percent stake in Lucent to AT&amp;T shareholders on that date.</p>
<p>Lucent will replace Outboard Marine Corp, which will be transferred to the S&amp;P SmallCap 600 Index, S&amp;P said.</p>
<p>Tricord Systems Inc will be removed from the S&amp;P SmallCap 600, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
